      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'A to move left

    D to move right

    Esc to pause

    R for quick
    retry


    Hit the ball to make it go up to hit the bricks; damaging them.

    Kill
    all bricks to win the level.

    If the ball falls it''ll reappear above you,
    but if there are bricks in the way it will reappear from the top of the screen.


    If
    your HP reaches 0 you die and lose the level.

    Good luck! The rest is yours
    to discover.


    (For an better experience, try challenging yourself by taking
    the least damage and killing the most bricks.)'
